<title>JAPAN: Toshiba Engineering - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toshiba Engineering - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 59.58		vs		55</p>
<p> Operating	  833    million    vs	  632    million</p>
<p> Current	    968    million    vs	  725    million</p>
<p> Net		  656    million    vs	  484    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.00 yen	  vs	    6.64 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     73 million	  vs	  73 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toshiba Engineering &amp; Construction Co Ltd is involved in installation work for thermal and nuclear power plants.</p>
</text>
